t the analog stick Y axis.\r\n* Added Cheat: infinite boost/brake.\r\n* Added Cheat: Laser Range multiplier.\r\n* Added Cheat: Rapid-fire.\r\n* Improved Jump to Map Developer functionality (Instant).\r\n* Added the Beta Coin replacement for the Gold Rings found inside the game.\r\n* Added the Beta boost/brake HUD found inside the game.\r\n* Added HUD aspect ratio customization independently from game aspect ratio.\r\n* Added option to disable Gorgon's boss screen flashes (Accessibility).\r\n* Added O2R (ZIP) support for assets, for ease of modding.\r\n* Added developer functionality to disable Gamma Boost.\r\n* Improved controller compatibility.\r\n* Added a more appropriate default controller mapping to the game.\r\n* Added Developer Pause.\r\n* Added SSE optimizations for Sound.\r\n* Added option to show outline for ships in radar.\r\n* Added option to show red background for all enemy radio messages (instead of just Andross).\r\n* Added option to customize cockpit glass opacity in First Person view.\r\n* Improved Matrix Float Precision.\r\n* Added 5.1 surround channel sound.\r\n* Ending can now be skipped if it was seen at least once.\r\n* Added texture interpolation for planet floors.\r\n* Added Render parallelization\r\n\r\nBugfixes:\r\n\r\n* Improved stability.\r\n* Fixed All-Range ground graphical bugs.\r\n* Fixed linux build.\r\n* Fixed collision bugs in Meteo and potentially other places.\r\n* Fixed some sound effects not playing correctly.\r\n* Fixed Venom 1 Boss \"Golemech\" electricity effect.\r\n* Fixed medals in the ranking.\r\n* Fixed data in the default ranking.\r\n* Fixed incorrect texture displacement for the radio noise.\r\n* Fixed items not despawning behind the player in All-Range mode.\r\n* Fixed fullscreen toggle bind key message.\r\n* Fixed alignment of the training ring counter.\r\n* Fixed texture scroll for the train wheels in Macbeth.\r\n* Fixed Sector Z actor spawner and added an option to correct a vanilla bug.\r\n* Fixed Titania's Boss \"Goras\" graphic issues.\r\n* Fixed audio crackling on Mac & Linux.\r\n* Fixed Zoness water shadows.\r\n* Fixed Developer Checkpoints to work per-level.\r\n* Fixed more graphic draw calls to widescreen.\r\n* Fixed Stereo audio phase shift.\r\n* Fixed muzzle flash interpolation.\r\n* Fixed Invulnerable cheat for solar and terrain.\r\n* Fixed some cutscenes to play at N64 Hardware speed.\r\n* Fixed bug where the ending wouldn't play after one sequential playthrough.\r\n* Fixed Electric Arc interpolation.\r\n* Fixed Mountain graphics in Corneria & Fortuna.\r\n* Fixed white flash that happened during Sector Y intro cutscene.\r\n\r\n## Running into issues?\r\n\r\nIf you’re running into any issues, please check on our [GitHub issue tracker](https://github.com/HarbourMasters/starship/issues) if yours is already documented there. If not, please submit it as one and help us out so we can fix it in the future!\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HarbourMasters/Starship/releases/220828885/reactions","total_count":102,"+1":22,"-1":0,"laugh":2,"hooray":22,"confused":0,"heart":38,"rocket":12,"eyes":6}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HarbourMasters/Starship/releases/192030387","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HarbourMasters/Starship/releases/192030387/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/HarbourMasters/Starship/releases/192030387/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/HarbourMasters/Starship/releases/tag/v1.0.0","id":192030387,"author":{"login":"sonicdcer","id":96613413,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcI0JQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96613413?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonicdcer","html_url":"https://github.com/sonicdcer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonicdcer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonicdcer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sonicdcer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/u